{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, adjoint x adjoint: untwisting the det6 x det2 formula and reading off CG coefficients (2026-10-10)\n\nImplements `L2-210-untwist-CG-spec.md`. Plain GT generators JJ, new conventions, diagonal frame.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup\n\nEverything below is a function of the twists (z, w); no globals zN/wN. GT generators JJ are plain (exact rationals, non-Hermitian); the invariant inner product is G = diag (found below) so that P_HW is the G-orthogonal projector, equivalent to the Hermitian EH frame of the Clean-CG notebooks.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state; this also clears the other new-conventions notebooks' session state (their files are untouched); Quiet because the front-end wrapper symbol ClearGlobals is Protected *)\nQuiet[ClearAll[\"Global`*\"]];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from L2-rotation-sov.wb *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;\npr = 200; Λ = {2, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2];\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5};\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d1]];\nE2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d1], Ee[i, j]];\n(* total gl(3) weight of each product basis state, in KroneckerProduct order *)\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\n(* gl(3) commutation relations of JJ *)\ncomm = Flatten[Table[Ee[i, j] . Ee[k, l] - Ee[k, l] . Ee[i, j] - (KroneckerDelta[j, k] Ee[i, l] - KroneckerDelta[l, i] Ee[k, j]), {i, 3}, {j, 3}, {k, 3}, {l, 3}]];\nchecks[\"JJ gl(3) relations\"] = Union[comm] === {0};\n(* invariant diagonal metric G (normalized G[[1]] = 1): Ee[i,j]^T G = G Ee[j,i]. JJ is not Hermitian, so projectors must be G-orthogonal (= orthogonal in the Hermitian EH frame) *)\ngv = Array[gg, d1];\ngsol = Solve[Flatten[Append[Table[Transpose[Ee[i, j]] . DiagonalMatrix[gv] - DiagonalMatrix[gv] . Ee[j, i], {i, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}], {gv[[1]] - 1}]] == 0, gv];\ngMet = DiagonalMatrix[gv /. First[gsol]];\nchecks[\"G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j]\"] = Length[gsol] === 1 && And @@ Positive[Diagonal[gMet]] && And @@ Flatten[Table[Transpose[Ee[i, j]] . gMet === gMet . Ee[j, i], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nchecks[\"nilpotency Ee[i,j]^3 = 0 (i != j)\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[If[i == j, True, MatrixPower[Ee[i, j], 3] === 0 Ee[i, j]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nGrid[{{\"d2\", d2}, {\"distinct weights\", Length[Union[wtBasis]]}, {\"checks\", ToString[Normal[checks]]}, {\"diag G\", ToString[Diagonal[gMet]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* monodromy T(v) = L^(1)(v-θ1).L^(2)(v-θ2) (exact); minors of T.diag(z) at the seven interpolation points uS (keep this name only for these points). For a diagonal twist the (I,I) minor is (prod z_I) times the untwisted minor, so the exact basis polynomials tBasisC[a, I] (coefficient matrices of u^k) are computed once and any twist costs only N[..] and a linear combination. *)\nTm[v_] := Tm[v] = Table[Sum[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[1]]) id2 + hN E1[i, k]) . (KroneckerDelta[k, j] (v - thN[[2]]) id2 + hN E2[k, j]), {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nuS = 1/7 + Range[0, 6]/3;\nminorAt[I_, v_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[Tm[v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], I[[k]]]], {k, Length[I]}], {σ, Permutations[I]}];\nvinv = Inverse[Table[uS[[k]]^j, {k, 7}, {j, 0, 6}]];\ntBasisC[a_, I_] := tBasisC[a, I] = With[{ms = Table[minorAt[I, uS[[k]]], {k, 7}]}, Table[Sum[vinv[[j, k]] ms[[k]], {k, 7}], {j, 7}]];\n(* t_a(u) as a list of seven numeric coefficient matrices (u^0..u^6) for the diagonal twist zz *)\ntZof[zz_] := tZof[zz] = Table[Sum[(Times @@ zz[[I]]) N[tBasisC[a, I], pr], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}], {a, 3}];\nauditNu[hh_, ths_, n_, x_] := Product[x - ths[[s]] + hh Λ[[n]], {s, Length[ths]}];\ntEval[tc_, a_, u0_] := Sum[u0^(j - 1) tc[[a, j]], {j, 7}];\n{tTime, tzTest} = AbsoluteTiming[tZof[N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]]];\n(* quantum determinant: t3(u) = (z1 z2 z3) nu1(u) nu2(u-h) nu3(u-2h) times the identity, at u = 1/5, -3/7 *)\nchecks[\"qdet: t3 = chi3 nu1(u)nu2(u-h)nu3(u-2h) (max abs dev, 2 points)\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[tEval[tzTest, 3, u0] - (3/2 5/4 2/3) auditNu[hN, thN, 1, u0] auditNu[hN, thN, 2, u0 - hN] auditNu[hN, thN, 3, u0 - 2 hN] id2]], {u0, {1/5, -3/7}}]];\nchecks[\"t_a commute (t1 t2 - t2 t1 at u=1/5, v=2/3: max abs)\"] = Max[Abs[tEval[tzTest, 1, 1/5] . tEval[tzTest, 2, 2/3] - tEval[tzTest, 2, 2/3] . tEval[tzTest, 1, 1/5]]];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tTime}, {\"qdet dev\", ScientificForm[checks[\"qdet: t3 = chi3 nu1(u)nu2(u-h)nu3(u-2h) (max abs dev, 2 points)\"], 3]}, {\"[t1,t2] dev\", ScientificForm[checks[\"t_a commute (t1 t2 - t2 t1 at u=1/5, v=2/3: max abs)\"], 3]}, {\"precision of t-coeffs\", Precision[tzTest[[2, 3]]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Gauss factors of the physical frame (rsSol, cell 6 of L2-rotation-sov.wb), the SoV vacuum x0 with the FACTORIZED inverse (never Inverse[Pph1] at small eps), one-site vacuum rotation Omega, rho(diag), and the u12 undo machinery. expN is exact for the nilpotent root generators (Ee[i,j]^3 = 0, checked) and keeps the precision of a numeric argument. *)\nzs = {z[1], z[2], z[3]}; ws = {w[1], w[2], w[3]};\nrsSol = {s[1] -> z[1]^2/((z[1] - z[2]) (z[1] - z[3])), s[2] -> -(z[2]/(z[1] (z[2] - z[3]))), s[3] -> 1/(z[1] z[2]), r[1] -> -(z[3]/z[2]), r[2] -> -(z[3]/z[1]), r[3] -> (z[2]^2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(z[1]^2 (z[2] - z[3]))};\nexpN[a_] := IdentityMatrix[Length[a]] + a + a . a/2 + a . a . a/6 + a . a . a . a/24;\nchecks[\"expN = MatrixExp on root generators (exact, 3 test values)\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[If[i == j, True, expN[c Ee[i, j]] === MatrixExp[c Ee[i, j]]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}, {c, {3/7, -5/2, 2}}]];\nx0Of[zz_] := Module[{rs, ppinv, pminv, dinv, x},\n  rs = rsSol /. Thread[zs -> zz];\n  ppinv = expN[-((zz[[1]] + zz[[2]])/(zz[[1]] zz[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]] . expN[(1/(zz[[1]] zz[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . expN[-(1/zz[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]];\n  pminv = expN[-(r[3] /. rs) Ee[2, 1]] . expN[-(r[2] /. rs) Ee[3, 1]] . expN[-(r[1] /. rs) Ee[3, 2]];\n  dinv = DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[(s[k] /. rs)^(-J0[k][p]), {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\n  x = UnitVector[d1, 1] . ppinv . dinv . pminv; Flatten[KroneckerProduct[x, x]]];\n(* control: factorized x0 = (e1^T Pph^-1)^(x)2 against the plain Inverse at an exact point *)\nx0Control[zz_] := Module[{rs = rsSol /. Thread[zs -> zz], Ppp, Pmp, Pdp, x},\n  Ppp = MatrixExp[(1/zz[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(zz[[1]] zz[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((zz[[1]] + zz[[2]])/(zz[[1]] zz[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]];\n  Pmp = MatrixExp[(r[1] /. rs) Ee[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[(r[2] /. rs) Ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[(r[3] /. rs) Ee[2, 1]];\n  Pdp = DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[(s[k] /. rs)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\n  x = First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . Inverse[Pmp . Pdp . Ppp]]; Flatten[KroneckerProduct[x, x]]];\nchecks[\"x0Of (factorized inverse) = x0 from Inverse[Pph1] (exact, z = (3/2,5/4,2/3))\"] = x0Of[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}] === x0Control[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}];\nρdiag[d_] := DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[d[[k]]^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\nDy[y1_, zz_] := Table[1/(y1 - zz[[i]]), {i, 3}];\n(* one-site vacuum rotation Omega_{(w1,w2,w3)} for ket twist zz (first row of exp(r1 E12) exp(r2 E13) exp(r3 E23)); w3 drops out *)\noneSiteVac[zz_, ww_] := Module[{rOmx}, rOmx = {r1 -> (w[1] - z[1])/(w[1] - z[2]), r2 -> ((w[1] - z[1]) (-w[2] + z[1]) (z[2] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (w[2] - z[3])), r3 -> ((w[1] - z[2]) (-w[2] + z[2]) (z[1] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (-w[2] + z[3]))} /. Join[Thread[zs -> zz], Thread[ws -> ww]];\n  First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . expN[(r1 /. rOmx) Ee[1, 2]] . expN[(r2 /. rOmx) Ee[1, 3]] . expN[(r3 /. rOmx) Ee[2, 3]]]];\n(* u12 machinery, parametrized by the twist zz, w1 and y; w2 = w2Of[y] (the regime of the spec: y = w2 y0 gives w2Of[y] = w2 exactly) *)\nth12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]]; t12 = th12/hN; y0 = (th12 - hN)/(th12 - 2 hN);\nw2Of[y_] := y (th12 - 2 hN)/(th12 - hN);\nu12e1 = UnitVector[d1, 1];\nu12rs[zz_, w1_, y_] := {(w1 - zz[[1]])/(w1 - zz[[2]]), ((w1 - zz[[1]]) (zz[[1]] - y) (zz[[2]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (w1 - zz[[3]]) (y - zz[[3]])), ((w1 - zz[[2]]) (zz[[2]] - y) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (w1 - zz[[3]]) (zz[[3]] - y))};\nu12nMat[zz_, w1_, y_] := With[{rv = u12rs[zz, w1, y]}, {{1, rv[[1]], rv[[2]] + rv[[1]] rv[[3]]}, {0, 1, rv[[3]]}, {0, 0, 1}}];\nu12rN[zz_, w1_, y_] := With[{rv = u12rs[zz, w1, y]}, expN[rv[[1]] Ee[1, 2]] . expN[rv[[2]] Ee[1, 3]] . expN[rv[[3]] Ee[2, 3]]];\nu12rNinv[zz_, w1_, y_] := With[{rv = u12rs[zz, w1, y]}, expN[-rv[[3]] Ee[2, 3]] . expN[-rv[[2]] Ee[1, 3]] . expN[-rv[[1]] Ee[1, 2]]];\nu12v2[zz_, w1_, y_] := oneSiteVac[zz, {w1, y, 1}];\nu12v1[zz_, w1_, y_] := u12v2[zz, w1, y] . ρdiag[Dy[w2Of[y], zz]];\nu12phi[zz_, w1_, y_] := u12v1[zz, w1, y] . u12rNinv[zz, w1, y];\n(* the regime of the spec: z = 1+eps phi, w1 = 1+eps om1, w2 = 1+eps om2, y = w2 y0 (exact rationals) *)\nreg[eps_, ph_, om1_, om2_] := <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"z\" -> 1 + eps ph, \"w1\" -> 1 + eps om1, \"w2\" -> 1 + eps om2, \"y\" -> (1 + eps om2) y0, \"w\" -> {1 + eps om1, 1 + eps om2, 1 + eps 2/9}|>;\nphiP = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; phiC = {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}; om1s = {3/4, -5/3, 7/2}; om2s = {-1/5, 9/7, -12/5, 5/3, 2/9, -7/4};\nomGrid = Flatten[Table[{o1, o2}, {o1, om1s}, {o2, om2s}], 1];\nchecks[\"y0 = -27/8, t12 = 62/35, w2Of[w2 y0] = w2\"] = (y0 === -27/8) && (t12 === 62/35) && (w2Of[(1 + 1/10^6 (-1/5)) y0] === 1 + 1/10^6 (-1/5));\nchecks[\"v2 = e1^T rho(n) exactly (regime point eps=10^-6)\"] = With[{R = reg[10^-6, phiP, 3/4, -1/5]}, u12v2[R[\"z\"] phiP/phiP, R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]] === u12e1 . u12rN[R[\"z\"] phiP/phiP, R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]]];\nGrid[{{\"checks\", ToString[Normal[checks]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* exact HW kets of V(x)V (common null space of the total raising ops per total-weight sector), weights, G-orthogonal projectors per HW sector. G2 = G(x)G is the invariant inner product (JJ is not Hermitian), so P_HW = H (H^T G2 H)^-1 H^T G2 is the projector that is orthogonal in the Hermitian EH frame. *)\nu12raiseM = Join[E1[1, 2] + E2[1, 2], E1[1, 3] + E2[1, 3], E1[2, 3] + E2[2, 3]];\nu12sectors = GatherBy[Range[d2], wtBasis[[#]] &];\nu12HW = Flatten[Table[Module[{ns = NullSpace[u12raiseM[[All, sec]]]}, Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> v], {d2}]], {v, ns}]], {sec, u12sectors}], 1];\nu12HWwt = Table[wtBasis[[FirstCase[Range[d2], k_ /; v[[k]] =!= 0]]], {v, u12HW}];\nu12e12 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[u12e1, u12e1]];\nhwSecs = {{4, 2, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 3, 0}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}};\ngd2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Diagonal[gMet], Diagonal[gMet]]];\nsecOf[mu_] := Flatten[Position[wtBasis, mu]];\nhwKets[mu_] := Select[u12HW, wtBasis[[FirstCase[Range[d2], k_ /; #[[k]] =!= 0]]] === mu &];\nhwH[mu_] := hwH[mu] = Transpose[hwKets[mu]];\nhwMinv[mu_] := hwMinv[mu] = Inverse[Transpose[hwH[mu]] . (gd2 hwH[mu])];\nPHWc[mu_][psi_] := hwH[mu] . (hwMinv[mu] . (Transpose[hwH[mu]] . (gd2 psi)));\nPHWall[psi_] := Sum[PHWc[mu][psi], {mu, hwSecs}];\ngNorm[psi_] := Sqrt[Total[gd2 psi^2]];\nchecks[\"12.2 number of HW kets = 6\"] = Length[u12HW];\nchecks[\"12.2 HW kets annihilated by all total raising ops\"] = And @@ (u12raiseM . # === ConstantArray[0, 3 d2] & /@ u12HW);\nchecks[\"HW multiplicities per sector (420,411,330,321,222)\"] = Length[hwKets[#]] & /@ hwSecs;\nchecks[\"sector sizes (420,411,330,321,222), total = 21\"] = Length[secOf[#]] & /@ hwSecs;\nchecks[\"G2-projector: idempotent, fixes HW kets, G2-orthogonal residual (exact)\"] = With[{vv = Table[(-1)^k k/7, {k, d2}]}, And @@ Table[PHWc[mu][PHWc[mu][vv]] === PHWc[mu][vv] && (And @@ (PHWc[mu][#] === # & /@ hwKets[mu])) && (And @@ (Total[gd2 hwKets[mu][[1]] (vv - PHWc[mu][vv])] === 0 & /@ {1})), {mu, hwSecs}]];\n(* exactness of the undo at a regime point: <v1(x)v2|HW> = s <phi(x)e1|HW> with s = (v2)_1 = 1 and the Gauss factor n fixing HW kets *)\nregTest = reg[10^-6, phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\nchecks[\"undo exact for the 6 HW kets (eps = 1e-6, om = (3/4,-1/5)) and (rho(n)(x)rho(n)).HW = HW\"] = With[{zz = regTest[\"z\"], w1 = regTest[\"w1\"], y = regTest[\"y\"]}, With[{v1 = u12v1[zz, w1, y], v2 = u12v2[zz, w1, y], ph = u12phi[zz, w1, y], R = KroneckerProduct[u12rN[zz, w1, y], u12rN[zz, w1, y]]}, {And @@ (Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]] . # === v2[[1]] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[ph, u12e1]] . # & /@ u12HW), And @@ (R . # === # & /@ u12HW), v2[[1]]}]];\nGrid[{{\"# HW kets\", checks[\"12.2 number of HW kets = 6\"]}, {\"multiplicities\", ToString[checks[\"HW multiplicities per sector (420,411,330,321,222)\"]]}, {\"sector sizes\", ToString[checks[\"sector sizes (420,411,330,321,222), total = 21\"]]}, {\"annihilated\", checks[\"12.2 HW kets annihilated by all total raising ops\"]}, {\"projector\", checks[\"G2-projector: idempotent, fixes HW kets, G2-orthogonal residual (exact)\"]}, {\"undo, R fixes HW, s\", ToString[checks[\"undo exact for the 6 HW kets (eps = 1e-6, om = (3/4,-1/5)) and (rho(n)(x)rho(n)).HW = HW\"]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Q machinery. A state is an association st = <|\"qu\" -> {q1,q2,q3} (monic dual polynomials in X, degrees mu_j), \"z\" -> ket twist|>; Q^j(x) = z_j^(x/h) q^j(x). Vacuum direct Q_i^vac(x) = w_i^(-x/h) q_i^vac(x), degrees (0,2,4), given as the function F[i, x]. Nothing is read from globals. *)\npoles = Flatten[Table[{s, n}, {s, nL}, {n, Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]}], 1];\nxP[{s_, n_}] := thN[[s]] - n hN;\nwgt[p_] := wgt[p] = 1/Product[xP[p] - xP[q], {q, DeleteCases[poles, p]}];\nins[1][x_] := 1; ins[2][x_] := Exp[2 Pi I x/hN];\nprsL1 = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nQUf[st_, j_, x_] := st[\"z\"][[j]]^(x/hN) (st[\"qu\"][[j]] /. X -> x);\nrowG[st_, F_, {i_, j_}, k_] := Sum[N[wgt[p] ins[k][xP[p]], pr] With[{x = xP[p]}, {-QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x], -x QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x], QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x + hN], x QUf[st, j, x] F[i, x + hN], QUf[st, j, x - hN] F[i, x], x QUf[st, j, x - hN] F[i, x]}], {p, poles}];\ndet6[st_, F_] := Det[Flatten[Table[rowG[st, F, ij, k], {k, 2}, {ij, prsL1}], 1]];\npsiQ[st_] := Product[With[{t = thN[[s]]}, (QUf[st, 2, t - 2 hN] QUf[st, 3, t - 3 hN] - QUf[st, 3, t - 2 hN] QUf[st, 2, t - 3 hN]) QUf[st, 3, t - hN]], {s, nL}];\n(* ladder-1 (site 1 only) brackets with the L=1 weights *)\npoles1 = Range[Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]]; wgt1[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[poles1, n]}];\nth1 = thN[[1]];\nbr1[f_] := Sum[wgt1[n] f[th1 - n hN], {n, poles1}];\nsu2det1[st_, y_] := Module[{E1x = Function[x, N[y^(-(x - th1)/hN), pr]]}, Det[Table[{-br1[Function[x, QUf[st, j, x] E1x[x]]], br1[Function[x, QUf[st, j, x - hN] E1x[x]]]}, {j, {3, 2}}]]];\nminor1[st_] := QUf[st, 2, th1 - 2 hN] QUf[st, 3, th1 - 3 hN] - QUf[st, 3, th1 - 2 hN] QUf[st, 2, th1 - 3 hN];\nmakeFvac[ww_, qv_] := Function[{i, x}, ww[[i]]^(-x/hN) (qv[[i]] /. X -> x)];\n(* fixed-degree monic Baxter solver (overdetermined least squares, no Chop), verbatim from L2-diagonal-frame-overlap-EH.wb cell 95 *)\nauditVac[zz_, hh_, ths_] := Table[Sum[Times @@ Table[zz[[ii[[k]]]] auditNu[hh, ths, ii[[k]], u - (k - 1) hh], {k, a}], {ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}], {a, 3}];\nauditQdet[zz_, hh_, ths_, x_] := (Times @@ zz) auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x] auditNu[hh, ths, 2, x - hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh];\nauditOp[tt_, q_, zz_, sgn_, hh_, ths_, x_] := If[sgn == 1,\n  auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh] zz (q /. X -> x + hh)\n  - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh] (q /. X -> x)\n  + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x) auditNu[hh, ths, 3, x - 2 hh] (q /. X -> x - hh)/zz\n  - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x) (q /. X -> x - 2 hh)/zz^2,\n  auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x] auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + 2 hh] zz (q /. X -> x - hh)\n  - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + hh] auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + 2 hh] (q /. X -> x)\n  + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hh) auditNu[hh, ths, 1, x + 2 hh] (q /. X -> x + hh)/zz\n  - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hh) (q /. X -> x + 2 hh)/zz^2];\nauditMonicQ[tt_, zz_, sgn_, deg_, hh_, ths_, prc_] := Module[{vars, eq, ar, sol},\n  If[deg == 0, Return[1]]; vars = Array[aq, deg]; eq = CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt, X^deg + Sum[vars[[k + 1]] X^k, {k, 0, deg - 1}], zz, sgn, hh, ths, X]], X];\n  ar = CoefficientArrays[eq, vars]; sol = LeastSquares[N[Normal[ar[[2]]], prc], -N[Normal[ar[[1]]], prc]];\n  Expand[X^deg + Sum[sol[[k + 1]] X^k, {k, 0, deg - 1}]]];\nauditNorm[v_, prc_] := Norm[SetPrecision[v, prc]];\n(* scaled Baxter residual of a set of Q's for transfer eigenvalues tt (pattern qres of diag-EH cell 99) *)\nbaxRes[tt_, qq_, zz_, sgn_] := Max[Table[auditNorm[CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt, qq[[j]], zz[[j]], sgn, hN, thN, X]], X], pr]/Max[1, Norm[CoefficientList[qq[[j]], X]]], {j, 3}]];\n(* vacuum direct Q's of a bra twist ww: eigenvalues auditVac, degrees 0,2,4 *)\nvacQs[ww_] := Module[{wn = N[ww, pr], tt, qv}, tt = auditVac[wn, hN, thN]; qv = Table[auditMonicQ[tt, wn[[j]], -1, 2 (j - 1), hN, thN, pr], {j, 3}]; <|\"tt\" -> tt, \"q\" -> qv, \"F\" -> makeFvac[wn, qv], \"res\" -> baxRes[tt, qv, wn, -1], \"w\" -> wn|>];\n{tVac, vq0} = AbsoluteTiming[vacQs[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}]];\nchecks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,2,4), Baxter residual\"] = {Exponent[vq0[\"q\"], X], vq0[\"res\"]};\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tVac}, {\"degrees\", ToString[checks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,2,4), Baxter residual\"][[1]]]}, {\"Baxter residual\", ScientificForm[checks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,2,4), Baxter residual\"][[2]], 3]}, {\"Precision\", Precision[vq0[\"res\"]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The residual above printed as an exact 0 with Precision Infinity: the trap of Clean-CG-combinations 7 (norm of tracked approximate zeros). Replacement: convert tt, q, z EXACTLY to rationals (SetPrecision[., Infinity]) and evaluate the Baxter operator in exact arithmetic, so the residual is the true violation of the stored numbers. *)\nClearAll[baxRes];\nbaxRes[tt_, qq_, zz_, sgn_] := Module[{t1 = SetPrecision[tt, Infinity], q1 = SetPrecision[qq, Infinity], z1 = SetPrecision[zz, Infinity]}, N[Max[Table[Norm[CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[t1, q1[[j]], z1[[j]], sgn, hN, thN, X]], X]]/Max[1, Norm[CoefficientList[q1[[j]], X]]], {j, 3}]], 6]];\nvq0 = vacQs[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}];\nchecks[\"vacuum Q's at w=(5/2,7/3,3/5): degrees (0,2,4), Baxter residual\"] = {Exponent[vq0[\"q\"], X], vq0[\"res\"]};\nGrid[{{\"degrees\", ToString[Exponent[vq0[\"q\"], X]]}, {\"Baxter residual (exact arithmetic on the stored numbers)\", ScientificForm[vq0[\"res\"], 3]}, {\"Precision of the coefficients of q_3\", Precision[vq0[\"q\"][[3]]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* all 21 eigenstates of the five HW sectors at the ket twist zz (exact rational list in, numeric pr inside), normalized <x0|Psi> = 1; the HW-limit branches are the dim(HW_mu) states of each sector with the smallest raising residual rr (copies ordered by Re of the eigenvalue of t1 + Pi t2 at u=3/7). Each state carries its transfer eigenvalue polynomials t1,t2 (read off at the largest component; coefficients above the true degrees are dropped and the dropped size is reported), t3 = quantum determinant, its dual Q's (degrees mu_j), the exact-arithmetic Baxter residual, and ||P_HW Psi||/||Psi|| in the invariant G-norm. *)\nbranchesAt[zz_] := branchesAt[zz] = Module[{zn = N[zz, pr], tc, x0, out = {}, dropMax = 0},\n  tc = tZof[zn]; x0 = x0Of[zn];\n  Do[Module[{sec = secOf[mu], mix, es, rr, nHW = Length[hwKets[mu]], pick, rank},\n    mix = (tEval[tc, 1, 3/7] + N[Pi, pr] tEval[tc, 2, 3/7])[[sec, sec]];\n    es = Eigensystem[mix];\n    rr = Table[Norm[Join[(E1[1, 2] + E2[1, 2])[[All, sec]] . v, (E1[2, 3] + E2[2, 3])[[All, sec]] . v]]/Norm[v], {v, es[[2]]}];\n    pick = SortBy[Ordering[rr, nHW], Re[es[[1, #]]] &];\n    Do[Module[{psiS, psi, km, tt, qq, st, copy},\n      psiS = es[[2, k]]/(x0[[sec]] . es[[2, k]]);\n      psi = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> psiS], {d2}]];\n      km = First@Ordering[Abs[psiS], -1];\n      tt = Table[Sum[u^(j - 1) ((tc[[a, j, sec, sec]] . psiS)[[km]]/psiS[[km]]), {j, 1 + 2 a}], {a, 2}];\n      dropMax = Max[dropMax, Max[Table[Abs[(tc[[a, j, sec, sec]] . psiS)[[km]]/psiS[[km]]], {a, 2}, {j, 2 a + 2, 7}]]];\n      tt = Append[tt, auditQdet[zn, hN, thN, u]];\n      qq = Table[auditMonicQ[tt, zn[[j]], 1, mu[[j]], hN, thN, pr], {j, 3}];\n      st = <|\"qu\" -> qq, \"z\" -> zn|>;\n      copy = If[MemberQ[pick, k], Position[pick, k][[1, 1]], 0];\n      AppendTo[out, <|\"mu\" -> mu, \"k\" -> k, \"branch\" -> (copy > 0), \"copy\" -> copy, \"psi\" -> psi, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"rr\" -> rr[[k]], \"tt\" -> tt, \"qu\" -> qq, \"st\" -> st, \"bax\" -> baxRes[tt, qq, zn, 1], \"hwFrac\" -> gNorm[PHWc[mu][psi]]/gNorm[psi], \"normG\" -> gNorm[psi]|>]], {k, Length[sec]}]], {mu, hwSecs}];\n  <|\"states\" -> out, \"dropMax\" -> dropMax, \"zz\" -> zz|>];\nbrOf[B_, mu_, copy_] := First@Select[B[\"states\"], #[\"mu\"] === mu && #[\"copy\"] === copy &];\nhwList = {{{4, 2, 0}, 1}, {{4, 1, 1}, 1}, {{3, 3, 0}, 1}, {{3, 2, 1}, 1}, {{3, 2, 1}, 2}, {{2, 2, 2}, 1}};\nbrList[B_] := brOf[B, #[[1]], #[[2]]] & /@ hwList;\nzTest = reg[10^-6, phiP, 3/4, -1/5][\"z\"];\n{tBr, B0} = AbsoluteTiming[branchesAt[zTest]];\nchecks[\"branches: 21 states, 6 HW-limit branches\"] = {Length[B0[\"states\"]], Count[B0[\"states\"], s_ /; s[\"branch\"]]};\nchecks[\"branches: top branch = e1(x)e1 (rel dev)\"] = With[{p = brOf[B0, {4, 2, 0}, 1][\"psi\"]}, N[Norm[p/p[[1]] - u12e12], 5]];\n(* separation of the HW-limit branches from the other states in each sector: max rr of picked vs min rr of the rest *)\nchecks[\"rr separation per sector (max branch rr / min other rr)\"] = Table[With[{s = Select[B0[\"states\"], #[\"mu\"] === mu &]}, {mu, N[Max[Select[s, #[\"branch\"] &][[All, \"rr\"]]], 3], If[Length[Select[s, ! #[\"branch\"] &]] == 0, \"-\", N[Min[Select[s, ! #[\"branch\"] &][[All, \"rr\"]]], 3]]}], {mu, hwSecs}];\nGrid[{{\"time (s), 21 states at eps=1e-6\", tBr}, {\"#states, #branches\", ToString[checks[\"branches: 21 states, 6 HW-limit branches\"]]}, {\"top = e1(x)e1, rel dev\", checks[\"branches: top branch = e1(x)e1 (rel dev)\"]}, {\"dropped high coeffs of t1,t2 (max abs)\", ScientificForm[N[B0[\"dropMax\"], 3]]}, {\"max exact Baxter residual (21 dual Q's)\", ScientificForm[Max[B0[\"states\"][[All, \"bax\"]]], 3]}, {\"hwFrac of the 6 branches\", ToString[N[brList[B0][[All, \"hwFrac\"]], 4]]}, {\"rr separation\", ToString[checks[\"rr separation per sector (max branch rr / min other rr)\"]]}, {\"Precision of psi (min over states)\", Min[Precision /@ B0[\"states\"][[All, \"psi\"]]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 0. Exact epsilon-structure of the undone covector in the regime (symbolic epsilon)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* phi(eps)/delta^Lambda = e1^T rho(n') (n' = Delta^-1 n Delta n^-1), delta^Lambda = d1^2 d2, d_k = 1/(w2 - z_k); symbolic epsilon, everything else rational *)\nu12wt1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nu12wts = Union[u12wt1]; u12idx = Table[Flatten[Position[u12wt1, m]], {m, u12wts}]; u12dims = Length /@ u12idx;\nphiScaled[ph_, o1_, o2_] := Module[{R = reg[epsS, ph, o1, o2], dl, zz, w1, y}, zz = R[\"z\"]; w1 = R[\"w1\"]; y = R[\"y\"]; dl = Table[1/(R[\"w2\"] - zz[[k]]), {k, 3}]; Together /@ (u12phi[zz, w1, y]/(dl[[1]]^2 dl[[2]]))];\nprimesOf[ph_, o1_, o2_] := Module[{R = reg[epsS, ph, o1, o2], dl, n}, dl = DiagonalMatrix[Table[1/(R[\"w2\"] - R[\"z\"][[k]]), {k, 3}]]; n = u12nMat[R[\"z\"], R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]]; Together /@ (Inverse[dl] . n . dl . Inverse[n])];\nser[expr_, k_] := Table[SeriesCoefficient[expr, {epsS, 0, j}], {j, 0, k}];\n{tT0, phS} = AbsoluteTiming[phiScaled[phiP, 3/4, -1/5]];\nphSer = ser[#, 3] & /@ phS;   (* 8 components x (eps^0..eps^3 coefficients) *)\n(* leading eps-order of a coefficient list c = {c0,c1,c2,c3}: number of leading exact zeros, or \"beyond 3\" *)\nleadOrd[c_] := If[AllTrue[c, # === 0 &], \"beyond 3\", LengthWhile[c, # === 0 &]];\nwtTab = Table[{u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], Table[leadOrd[phSer[[i]]], {i, u12idx[[m]]}], Table[With[{lo = leadOrd[phSer[[i]]]}, If[IntegerQ[lo], phSer[[i, lo + 1]], 0]], {i, u12idx[[m]]}]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}];\n(* (i)-(iii) *)\nnpr = primesOf[phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\nap = npr[[1, 2]]; bp = npr[[1, 3]]; cp = npr[[2, 3]];\nap0 = (3/4 - phiP[[1]]) (phiP[[2]] - phiP[[1]])/((3/4 - phiP[[2]]) (-1/5 - phiP[[2]]));\nchecks[\"T0 (i) a' is exactly eps-free and = (om1-phi1)(phi2-phi1)/((om1-phi2)(om2-phi2))\"] = FreeQ[ap, epsS] && Simplify[ap - ap0] === 0;\nratS = Series[Together[bp/(ap cp)], {epsS, 0, 2}];\nchecks[\"T0 (ii) b'/(a'c') = 1 + eps (t-2)(phi2-om2) + O(eps^2): coefficient\"] = {SeriesCoefficient[ratS, 0], SeriesCoefficient[ratS, 1], (t12 - 2) (phiP[[2]] + 1/5)};\ncp0 = Limit[cp, epsS -> 0]; bp0 = Limit[bp, epsS -> 0];\nphi0 = Limit[#, epsS -> 0] & /@ phS;\nchecks[\"T0 (iii) phi0 = e1^T exp(a'0 E12) exp(c'0 E23) (exact), and reversed order\"] = {phi0 === u12e1 . expN[ap0 Ee[1, 2]] . expN[cp0 Ee[2, 3]], phi0 === u12e1 . expN[cp0 Ee[2, 3]] . expN[ap0 Ee[1, 2]], bp0 === ap0 cp0};\nchecks[\"T0 (iv) phi0 components by weight (leading orders table)\"] = wtTab;\n(* (0,1,2): O(eps) coefficient divided by (a'0 c'0)^2, factored *)\nidx012 = First@u12idx[[Position[u12wts, {0, 1, 2}][[1, 1]]]];\nc012 = Factor[phSer[[idx012, 2]]/(ap0 cp0)^2];\nGrid[Join[{{\"weight\", \"dim\", \"lead order(s)\", \"lead coefficient(s)\"}}, wtTab, {{\"(i) a' eps-free, = formula\", checks[\"T0 (i) a' is exactly eps-free and = (om1-phi1)(phi2-phi1)/((om1-phi2)(om2-phi2))\"]}, {\"a'0, c'0, b'0\", ToString[{ap0, cp0, bp0}]}, {\"(ii) coeffs: b'/a'c' at eps^0, eps^1, predicted\", ToString[checks[\"T0 (ii) b'/(a'c') = 1 + eps (t-2)(phi2-om2) + O(eps^2): coefficient\"]]}, {\"(iii) phi0 = e1 exp(aE12) exp(cE23); reversed; b'0 = a'0 c'0\", ToString[checks[\"T0 (iii) phi0 = e1^T exp(a'0 E12) exp(c'0 E23) (exact), and reversed order\"]]}, {\"(0,1,2) eps^1 coeff / (a'0 c'0)^2\", ToString[c012]}, {\"time (s)\", tT0}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* per-weight ranks over the 3x6 grid of (om1, om2), exact: eps^0 coefficient vectors, eps^1 coefficient vectors, both together; also the leading orders over the grid (0 = O(1), 1 = O(eps), 2 = beyond), for phi (primary) and phi' (control) *)\nrankTab[ph_] := Module[{ser18 = Table[ser[#, 1] & /@ phiScaled[ph, o[[1]], o[[2]]], {o, omGrid}]},\n  Table[With[{ix = u12idx[[m]]}, With[{c0 = Table[s[[ix, 1]], {s, ser18}], c1 = Table[s[[ix, 2]], {s, ser18}]}, {u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], MatrixRank[c0], MatrixRank[c1], MatrixRank[Join[c0, c1]], Union[Flatten[Table[leadOrd[Append[s[[i]], 1]], {s, ser18}, {i, ix}]]]}]], {m, Length[u12wts]}]];\n{tRk, rk1} = AbsoluteTiming[rankTab[phiP]];\nrk2 = rankTab[phiC];\nchecks[\"T0 grid ranks, phi primary (weight, dim, rk eps^0, rk eps^1, rk both, leading orders over grid)\"] = rk1;\nchecks[\"T0 grid ranks, phi' control\"] = rk2;\n(* expectation of the spec: (1,1,1): rank 1 of 2 at eps^0 and rank 2 including eps^1; (2,1,0),(1,2,0),(2,0,1),(1,0,2): O(1); (0,2,1),(0,1,2): O(eps) *)\nokRk[rk_] := (Select[rk, #[[1]] === {1, 1, 1} &][[1, {3, 5}]] === {1, 2}) && (Select[rk, #[[1]] === {0, 2, 1} &][[1, 6]] === {1}) && (Select[rk, #[[1]] === {0, 1, 2} &][[1, 6]] === {1}) && (Select[rk, MemberQ[{{2, 1, 0}, {1, 2, 0}, {2, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 2}}, #[[1]]] &][[All, 6]] === {{0}, {0}, {0}, {0}});\nchecks[\"T0 (iv) expected structure holds on the whole grid, phi and phi'\"] = {okRk[rk1], okRk[rk2], rk1 === rk2};\nGrid[Join[{{\"weight\", \"dim\", \"rank eps^0\", \"rank eps^1\", \"rank both\", \"lead orders on grid\"}}, rk1, {{\"phi' control\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, rk2, {{\"expected structure holds: phi, phi', identical tables\", ToString[checks[\"T0 (iv) expected structure holds on the whole grid, phi and phi'\"]]}, {\"time (s)\", tRk}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 1. Chain side: signal vs contamination in the regime",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* R_C = <v1(x)v2|Psi_B> (<x0|Psi_B> = 1), S = <v1(x)v2|P_HW Psi_B> (G-orthogonal projector onto the HW space of the sector), K = R_C - S; exact undo check S = s <phi(x)e1|P_HW Psi_B>. v1, v2, phi are exact rationals in eps, converted with N[., pr] *)\nepsL = {10^-6, 2 10^-6, 4 10^-6};\nvecsAt[R_] := Module[{zz = R[\"z\"], w1 = R[\"w1\"], y = R[\"y\"], v1, v2, ph},\n  v1 = u12v1[zz, w1, y]; v2 = u12v2[zz, w1, y]; ph = u12phi[zz, w1, y];\n  <|\"v12\" -> N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]], pr], \"phe1\" -> N[v2[[1]] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[ph, u12e1]], pr]|>];\nt1Point[B_, R_] := Module[{V = vecsAt[R]},\n  Table[With[{b = brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]}, Module[{psi = b[\"psi\"], Ph, RC, S, undo},\n    Ph = PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][psi]; RC = V[\"v12\"] . psi; S = V[\"v12\"] . Ph; undo = V[\"phe1\"] . Ph;\n    <|\"RC\" -> RC, \"S\" -> S, \"K\" -> RC - S, \"undoRel\" -> Abs[(S - undo)/S], \"normPsi\" -> b[\"normG\"], \"hwFrac\" -> b[\"hwFrac\"], \"ev\" -> b[\"ev\"]|>]], {ib, 6}]];\n(* time one parameter point (all 6 branches) *)\nR1 = reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\n{tBr1, B1} = AbsoluteTiming[branchesAt[R1[\"z\"]]];\n{tPt1, pt1} = AbsoluteTiming[t1Point[B1, R1]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[pt1[[ib, \"RC\"]]], 4]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[pt1[[ib, \"S\"]]], 4]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[pt1[[ib, \"K\"]]], 4]], ScientificForm[N[pt1[[ib, \"undoRel\"]], 3]], Precision[pt1[[ib, \"K\"]]]}, {ib, 6}], {\"mu\", \"copy\", \"|R_C|\", \"|S|\", \"|K|\", \"undo rel dev\", \"Precision(K)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* full Task 1 loop: 3 eps x 18 omega x 6 branches (branches depend on eps only) *)\nfmt[x_] := With[{m = N[x]}, If[m == 0., \"0[acc \" <> ToString[Round[Accuracy[x]]] <> \"]\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[m]]]}, ToString[Round[m/10^e, 0.01]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]]];\n{tLoop1, T1} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]]}, t1Point[branchesAt[R[\"z\"]], R]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}]];\n(* exponent of a quantity between consecutive eps's (ratio 2): log2 *)\nexpo[f_] := Table[Log[Abs[f[ie + 1]/f[ie]]]/Log[2], {ie, 2}];\nexpS = Table[expo[Function[ie, T1[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]]]], {ib, 6}, {io, 18}];\nexpK = Table[If[ib == 1, {{0, 0}}, expo[Function[ie, T1[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]]]], {ib, 6}, {io, 18}];\nexpNorm = Table[expo[Function[ie, T1[[ie, 1, ib, \"normPsi\"]]]], {ib, 6}];\nkap[ie_, io_, ib_] := T1[[ie, io, ib, \"RC\"]]/T1[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]];\nmaxKS[ie_, ib_] := Max[Table[Abs[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]/T1[[ie, io, ib, \"S\"]]], {io, 18}]];\nioA = Position[omGrid, {3/4, -1/5}][[1, 1]]; ioB = Position[omGrid, {7/2, -7/4}][[1, 1]];\nchecks[\"T1 exact undo S = s<phi(x)e1|P_HW Psi>: max rel dev over 324 points\"] = Max[Table[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"undoRel\"]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}, {ib, 6}]];\nchecks[\"T1 min Precision of K over all points\"] = Min[Table[Precision[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"K\"]]], {ie, 3}, {io, 18}, {ib, 6}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"S: eps-exp (pair 1, pair 2) at om A\", \"S: exp range over 18 om\", \"K: exp at om A\", \"K: exp range\", \"||Psi||: exp\", \"kappa(eps) om A\", \"kappa(eps) om B\", \"max|K/S| (3 eps)\"}}, Table[{hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], ToString[N[expS[[ib, ioA]], 4]], ToString[N[{Min[Flatten[expS[[ib]]]], Max[Flatten[expS[[ib]]]]}, 4]], If[ib == 1, \"K = 0 exactly\", ToString[N[expK[[ib, ioA]], 4]]], If[ib == 1, \"-\", ToString[N[{Min[Flatten[expK[[ib]]]], Max[Flatten[expK[[ib]]]]}, 4]]], ToString[N[expNorm[[ib]], 4]], ToString[N[Table[kap[ie, ioA, ib], {ie, 3}], 8]], ToString[N[Table[kap[ie, ioB, ib], {ie, 3}], 8]], ToString[Table[fmt[maxKS[ie, ib]], {ie, 3}]]}, {ib, 6}], {{\"undo max rel dev\", ScientificForm[N[checks[\"T1 exact undo S = s<phi(x)e1|P_HW Psi>: max rel dev over 324 points\"]], 3]}, {\"min Precision(K)\", checks[\"T1 min Precision of K over all points\"]}, {\"time (s)\", tLoop1}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* showContam: K = <v1(x)v2|Psi_perp> = <phi(x)e1|R Psi_perp> with R = rho(n)(x)rho(n) (site-2 vacuum rotation), phi = u12phi (includes delta^Lambda). Sum over site-1 components a of phi_a [R Psi_perp]_(a,1), grouped by the GT weight nu of a: c_nu. Reported at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, with the eps-exponent of each c_nu and of its fraction of K. *)\ncontamAt[R_, ib_] := Module[{zz = R[\"z\"], w1 = R[\"w1\"], y = R[\"y\"], b, psi, perp, Rn, Rp, ph, terms},\n  b = brOf[branchesAt[zz], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]; psi = b[\"psi\"]; perp = psi - PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][psi];\n  Rn = N[u12rN[zz, w1, y], pr]; Rp = (KroneckerProduct[Rn, Rn]) . perp;\n  ph = N[u12phi[zz, w1, y], pr];\n  terms = Table[ph[[a]] Rp[[(a - 1) d1 + 1]], {a, d1}];\n  <|\"c\" -> Table[Total[terms[[ix]]], {ix, u12idx}], \"K\" -> Total[terms], \"Kdirect\" -> N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[u12v1[zz, w1, y], u12v2[zz, w1, y]]], pr] . perp|>];\ncontamTab[ib_] := Module[{c = Table[contamAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], ib], {ie, 2}]},\n  Table[{u12wts[[m]], fmt[c[[1, \"c\", m]]], fmt[c[[2, \"c\", m]]], If[c[[1, \"c\", m]] == 0, \"-\", ToString[Round[Log[Abs[c[[2, \"c\", m]]/c[[1, \"c\", m]]]]/Log[2], 0.01]]], fmt[Abs[c[[1, \"c\", m]]/c[[1, \"K\"]]]]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}]];\nct6 = contamTab[6]; ct4 = contamTab[4];\ncK = Table[contamAt[reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], ib], {ib, {4, 6}}];\nchecks[\"T1 showContam: sum_nu c_nu = K = <v1(x)v2|Psi_perp> (rel dev, octet1, singlet)\"] = Table[N[Abs[c[\"K\"]/c[\"Kdirect\"] - 1]], {c, cK}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"SINGLET [2,2,2]: site-1 weight nu\", \"c_nu (eps=1e-6)\", \"c_nu (2e-6)\", \"eps-exponent\", \"|c_nu/K| at 1e-6\"}}, ct6, {{\"OCTET copy 1 [3,2,1]\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, ct4, {{\"sum c_nu = K check (octet1, singlet)\", ToString[checks[\"T1 showContam: sum_nu c_nu = K = <v1(x)v2|Psi_perp> (rel dev, octet1, singlet)\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 2. Q side at small epsilon and the CG numbers from the formula",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* R_Q(B) = det6[B, Fvac(w1,w2)]/psiQ[B] x su2det1[B, y]/minor1[B], y = w2 y0. Vacuum direct Q's of the twist (w1, w2, w3): w3 drops out of the identity, so it is set to 1 + eps 5/13, which never coincides with w2 (the grid contains om2 = 2/9, where the spec's w3 = 1 + eps 2/9 would make two vacuum twists equal and the Baxter solve ill-conditioned: Baxter residual 4e-10 observed) *)\nrQ[st_, vq_, y_] := det6[st, vq[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st] su2det1[st, y]/minor1[st];\nvqAt[R_] := vacQs[{R[\"w\"][[1]], R[\"w\"][[2]], 1 + R[\"eps\"] 5/13}];\n(* time one parameter point: vacuum Q's + R_Q for 6 branches, and R_C *)\nR1 = reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5];\n{tVq, vq1} = AbsoluteTiming[vqAt[R1]];\nB1 = branchesAt[R1[\"z\"]];\n{tRq, rq1} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[rQ[brOf[B1, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], vq1, R1[\"y\"]], {ib, 6}]];\nrc1 = Table[T1[[1, ioA, ib, \"RC\"]], {ib, 6}];\nratio1 = rc1/rq1;\nGrid[{{\"time vacuum Q's (s)\", tVq}, {\"time R_Q x6 (s)\", tRq}, {\"vacuum Q Baxter residual, degrees\", ToString[{N[vq1[\"res\"], 3], Exponent[vq1[\"q\"], X]}]}, {\"R_C/R_Q over 6 branches: max |r/r_top - 1|\", ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[ratio1/ratio1[[1]] - 1]]], 3]}, {\"Precision of R_Q\", ToString[Precision /@ rq1]}, {\"max exact Baxter residual of the 6 dual Q's\", ScientificForm[N[Max[Table[brOf[B1, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"bax\"], {ib, 6}]]], 3]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 2 loop: eps in {1e-6, 4e-6} (indices 1, 3 of epsL), 18 omegas: vacuum Q's of (w1,w2,w3), R_Q for the 6 branches, state independence of R_C/R_Q, and Qnum(B) = R_Q(B)/R_Q(top) <v1(x)v2|e1(x)e1>/<x0|e1(x)e1> *)\nq2Point[ie_, io_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]], B, vq, rq, V, x0, topFac, qnum},\n  B = branchesAt[R[\"z\"]]; vq = vqAt[R];\n  rq = Table[rQ[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], vq, R[\"y\"]], {ib, 6}];\n  V = vecsAt[R]; x0 = x0Of[N[R[\"z\"], pr]];\n  topFac = (V[\"v12\"] . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12);\n  qnum = rq/rq[[1]] topFac;\n  <|\"rq\" -> rq, \"qnum\" -> qnum, \"vqres\" -> vq[\"res\"], \"vqdeg\" -> Exponent[vq[\"q\"], X]|>];\nepsIx = {1, 3};\n{tT2, T2} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[q2Point[ie, io], {ie, epsIx}, {io, 18}]];\nrcOf[ie_, io_] := Table[T1[[ie, io, ib, \"RC\"]], {ib, 6}];\nratioDev = Table[With[{r = rcOf[epsIx[[k]], io]/T2[[k, io, \"rq\"]]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]], {k, 2}, {io, 18}];\nqnumDev = Table[Max[Abs[T2[[k, io, \"qnum\"]]/rcOf[epsIx[[k]], io] - 1]], {k, 2}, {io, 18}];\nprecRq = Min[Table[Precision[T2[[k, io, \"rq\"]]], {k, 2}, {io, 18}]];\nchecks[\"T2 max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's (36 twists), dual Q's (2 eps)\"] = {Max[Table[T2[[k, io, \"vqres\"]], {k, 2}, {io, 18}]], Max[Table[brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"bax\"], {ie, epsIx}, {ib, 6}]]};\nchecks[\"T2 vacuum Q degrees all (0,2,4)\"] = Union[Flatten[Table[T2[[k, io, \"vqdeg\"]], {k, 2}, {io, 18}], 1]];\nchecks[\"T2 R_C/R_Q state independence over 6 branches: max over 36 points\"] = {Max[ratioDev[[1]]], Max[ratioDev[[2]]]};\nchecks[\"T2 Qnum = R_C: max rel dev over 36 points x 6 branches\"] = {Max[qnumDev[[1]]], Max[qnumDev[[2]]]};\nchecks[\"T2 min Precision(R_Q)\"] = precRq;\n(* all 21 states of the five HW sectors at one parameter point per eps (omega A) *)\nall21[ie_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], B, vq, V, rc, rq},\n  B = branchesAt[R[\"z\"]]; vq = vqAt[R]; V = vecsAt[R];\n  rc = Table[V[\"v12\"] . s[\"psi\"], {s, B[\"states\"]}]; rq = Table[rQ[s[\"st\"], vq, R[\"y\"]], {s, B[\"states\"]}];\n  With[{r = rc/rq}, {Length[rc], Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]], Min[Precision /@ rq]}]];\nchecks[\"T2 21 states: (count, max|ratio/ratio_1 - 1|, min Precision R_Q), eps = 1e-6 and 4e-6\"] = {all21[1], all21[3]};\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tT2}, {\"max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's, dual Q's\", ToString[N[checks[\"T2 max Baxter residual: vacuum Q's (36 twists), dual Q's (2 eps)\"], 3]]}, {\"vacuum Q degrees\", ToString[checks[\"T2 vacuum Q degrees all (0,2,4)\"]]}, {\"R_C/R_Q state-independence over 6 branches (max over 18 om): eps 1e-6, 4e-6\", ToString[N[checks[\"T2 R_C/R_Q state independence over 6 branches: max over 36 points\"], 3]]}, {\"Qnum = R_C max rel dev\", ToString[N[checks[\"T2 Qnum = R_C: max rel dev over 36 points x 6 branches\"], 3]]}, {\"min Precision R_Q\", precRq}, {\"21 states (eps 1e-6; 4e-6): count, max dev, min Precision\", ToString[N[checks[\"T2 21 states: (count, max|ratio/ratio_1 - 1|, min Precision R_Q), eps = 1e-6 and 4e-6\"], 3]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* CG extraction from Qnum alone at leading order. Chain side: C_B(eps) = f . [P_HW Psi_B]_(site-1 weight nu, site 2 = e1), f = 1 for the 1-dim weights (2,0,1) [4,1,1] and (1,2,0) [3,3,0], f = hat = phi0_(1,1,1)/(a'0 c'0) for the octets (the (u+u') functional). Q side: C^Q(om, eps) = Qnum/(delta^Lambda(eps, om) fac(om)), delta^Lambda = d1^2 d2 the explicit known prefactor of v1, fac = c'0 ([4,1,1]), a'0 ([3,3,0]), a'0 c'0 (octets), with the closed forms of the eps = 0 covector phi0(om). *)\na0Of[om_] := (om[[1]] - phiP[[1]]) (phiP[[2]] - phiP[[1]])/((om[[1]] - phiP[[2]]) (om[[2]] - phiP[[2]]));\nc0Of[om_] := ((om[[1]] - phiP[[2]]) (phiP[[1]] - phiP[[3]])/((phiP[[1]] - phiP[[2]]) (om[[1]] - phiP[[3]]))) (phiP[[3]] - phiP[[2]])/(om[[2]] - phiP[[3]]);\nphi0Of[om_] := u12e1 . expN[a0Of[om] Ee[1, 2]] . expN[c0Of[om] Ee[2, 3]];\ndeltaL[R_] := 1/((R[\"w2\"] - R[\"z\"][[1]])^2 (R[\"w2\"] - R[\"z\"][[2]]));\nidxOf[wt_] := u12idx[[Position[u12wts, wt][[1, 1]]]];\nidx111 = idxOf[{1, 1, 1}];\nhat111 = Table[phi0Of[om][[idx111]]/(a0Of[om] c0Of[om]), {om, omGrid}];\nchecks[\"T2 closed forms: c'0 = 2755/3549 at om A; phi0(om)_(1,1,1)/(a'0 c'0) is om-independent (distinct vectors over 18 om)\"] = {c0Of[{3/4, -1/5}] === 2755/3549, Length[Union[hat111]], First[hat111]};\nchecks[\"T2 phi_scaled(eps = 1e-6) -> phi0 (max rel dev of the O(1) components, ~eps)\"] = With[{R = reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5]}, With[{ps1 = u12phi[R[\"z\"], R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]] deltaL[R]^-1/ (1)}, N[Max[Abs[(ps1[[Flatten[idxOf /@ {{2, 1, 0}, {1, 2, 0}, {2, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 2}}]]]/phi0Of[{3/4, -1/5}][[Flatten[idxOf /@ {{2, 1, 0}, {1, 2, 0}, {2, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 2}}]]]) - 1]]]]];\ncgSpec = {{2, {2, 0, 1}, c0Of[#] &, {1}}, {3, {1, 2, 0}, a0Of[#] &, {1}}, {4, {1, 1, 1}, a0Of[#] c0Of[#] &, First[hat111]}, {5, {1, 1, 1}, a0Of[#] c0Of[#] &, First[hat111]}};\nchainC[ie_, ib_] := With[{sp = Select[cgSpec, #[[1]] == ib &][[1]], b = brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]]}, With[{ph = PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][b[\"psi\"]]}, sp[[4]] . ph[[(idxOf[sp[[2]]] - 1) d1 + 1]]]];\nqC[k_, io_, ib_] := With[{sp = Select[cgSpec, #[[1]] == ib &][[1]], R = reg[epsL[[epsIx[[k]]]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]]}, T2[[k, io, \"qnum\"]][[ib]]/(deltaL[R] sp[[3]][omGrid[[io]]])];\ncgTab = Table[With[{cc = Table[chainC[epsIx[[k]], ib], {k, 2}], qq = Table[qC[k, io, ib], {k, 2}, {io, 18}]}, {hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], Table[{N[Max[Abs[qq[[k]]/Mean[qq[[k]]] - 1]], 4], N[Max[Abs[qq[[k]]/cc[[k]] - 1]], 4]}, {k, 2}]}], {ib, 2, 5}];\n(* eps-scaling: ratio (4e-6)/(1e-6) of the spread and of the error *)\ncgScal = Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], N[r[[3, 2, 1]]/r[[3, 1, 1]], 3], N[r[[3, 2, 2]]/r[[3, 1, 2]], 3]}, {r, cgTab}];\n(* 27: trivial check Qnum(top) = delta^Lambda * Psi_top(1,1) *)\nchecks[\"T2 27: Qnum/(delta^Lambda) = [Psi_top]_(11) (max rel dev over 18 om, both eps)\"] = N[Max[Table[Abs[T2[[k, io, \"qnum\"]][[1]]/(deltaL[reg[epsL[[epsIx[[k]]]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]]] brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[epsIx[[k]]]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], {4, 2, 0}, 1][\"psi\"][[1]]) - 1], {k, 2}, {io, 18}]], 3];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"(spread over 18 om, error vs chain) at eps = 1e-6\", \"... at 4e-6\", \"scaling 4e-6/1e-6: spread, error\"}}, Table[{cgTab[[i, 1]], cgTab[[i, 2]], ToString[cgTab[[i, 3, 1]]], ToString[cgTab[[i, 3, 2]]], ToString[cgScal[[i, 3 ;; 4]]]}, {i, 4}], {{\"27 trivial check\", checks[\"T2 27: Qnum/(delta^Lambda) = [Psi_top]_(11) (max rel dev over 18 om, both eps)\"]}, {\"c'0 closed form, #distinct hat vectors, hat\", ToString[checks[\"T2 closed forms: c'0 = 2755/3549 at om A; phi0(om)_(1,1,1)/(a'0 c'0) is om-independent (distinct vectors over 18 om)\"]]}, {\"phi_scaled -> phi0 rel dev (eps = 1e-6)\", checks[\"T2 phi_scaled(eps = 1e-6) -> phi0 (max rel dev of the O(1) components, ~eps)\"]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Richardson in eps (1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6) at om A for f(eps) = C(eps) eps^(-p_B), p_B = eps-exponent of ||Psi_B|| from Task 1 (-3 for [4,1,1], [3,3,0]; -4 for the octets). Second-order Richardson: R1(e) = 2 f(e) - f(2e) removes the O(eps) term, R2 = (4 R1(e) - R1(2e))/3 the O(eps^2) term. Chain side from the branches, Q side from Qnum only (the third eps is run only here, at one om). *)\nq3 = Table[q2Point[ie, ioA], {ie, 3}];\nqCfull[ie_, ib_] := With[{sp = Select[cgSpec, #[[1]] == ib &][[1]], R = reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5]}, q3[[ie, \"qnum\"]][[ib]]/(deltaL[R] sp[[3]][{3/4, -1/5}])];\nrich[f_] := Module[{r1 = 2 f[[1]] - f[[2]], r2 = 2 f[[2]] - f[[3]]}, {r1, r2, (4 r1 - r2)/3}];\nrichTab = Table[Module[{pB = Round[expNorm[[ib, 1]]], fc, fq, rc, rq},\n   fc = Table[chainC[ie, ib] epsL[[ie]]^(-pB), {ie, 3}]; fq = Table[qCfull[ie, ib] epsL[[ie]]^(-pB), {ie, 3}];\n   rc = rich[fc]; rq = rich[fq];\n   {hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], pB, fc, fq, rc[[3]], rq[[3]], Abs[rq[[3]]/rc[[3]] - 1], Max[Abs[fq/fc - 1]], Abs[fq[[1]]/rq[[3]] - 1]}], {ib, 2, 5}];\nchecks[\"T2 Richardson (mu, copy, p_B, f_chain(3 eps), f_Q(3 eps), R2 chain, R2 Q, |R2Q/R2chain - 1|, max_eps |fQ/fchain - 1|, |fQ(1e-6)/R2Q - 1|)\"] = richTab;\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"p_B\", \"R2 chain\", \"R2 Q\", \"|R2Q/R2chain - 1|\", \"max_eps |fQ/fchain - 1| (O(eps))\", \"|fQ(1e-6)/R2Q - 1| (O(eps))\"}}, Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], r[[3]], N[r[[6]], 12], N[r[[7]], 12], ScientificForm[N[r[[8]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[r[[9]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[r[[10]], 3]]}, {r, richTab}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 3. Diagnostic for the O(eps) layer (octets, singlet): top-killed ratios rho_B",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* top-killed quantities: T = delta^Lambda s <v2(x)v2|Psi_B>/<x0|Psi_B> (the plain vacuum overlap of the twist (w1, y), s = (v2)_1 = 1), R_C^tk = R_C - T, K^tk = K - T, rho_B = K^tk/S (literal spec definition). First the Q-number identity <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[B, Fvac(w1,y,w3)]/psiQ[B] normalized by the top state. *)\nt3Data[ph_, ie_, om_] := Module[{R = reg[epsL[[ie]], ph, om[[1]], om[[2]]], B, zz, V, v2, v2v2, dl, p1},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; p1 = t1Point[B, R]; dl = deltaL[R];\n  v2 = u12v2[zz, R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]]; v2v2 = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v2, v2]], pr];\n  Table[With[{psi = brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"psi\"], d = p1[[ib]]}, With[{T = dl v2[[1]] (v2v2 . psi)}, <|\"S\" -> d[\"S\"], \"K\" -> d[\"K\"], \"T\" -> T, \"RCtk\" -> d[\"RC\"] - T, \"Ktk\" -> d[\"K\"] - T, \"rho\" -> (d[\"K\"] - T)/d[\"S\"]|>]], {ib, 6}]];\n(* Q-number identity for T at one point (eps = 1e-6, om A), all 6 branches *)\nqT = Module[{R = reg[epsL[[1]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5], B, zz, v2, v2v2, x0, vq, top, topOv, rq},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; v2 = u12v2[zz, R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]]; v2v2 = N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v2, v2]], pr]; x0 = x0Of[N[zz, pr]];\n  vq = vacQs[{R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"], 1 + R[\"eps\"] 5/13}];\n  rq = Table[det6[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"], vq[\"F\"]]/psiQ[brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"]], {ib, 6}];\n  topOv = (v2v2 . u12e12)/(x0 . u12e12);\n  <|\"vacRes\" -> vq[\"res\"], \"dev\" -> Max[Table[Abs[rq[[ib]]/rq[[1]] topOv/(v2v2 . brOf[B, hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"psi\"]) - 1], {ib, 6}]]|>];\nchecks[\"T3 <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[Fvac(w1,y)]/psiQ x top normalization: max rel dev, vacuum Baxter residual\"] = {N[qT[\"dev\"], 3], N[qT[\"vacRes\"], 3], Precision[qT[\"dev\"]]};\n{tT3, T3a} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[t3Data[phiP, ie, om], {ie, {1, 3}}, {om, omGrid}]];\nrhoOf[k_, io_, ib_] := T3a[[k, io, ib, \"rho\"]];\nchecks[\"T3 (a) eps-independence of rho_B: max over 18 om of |rho(4e-6)/rho(1e-6) - 1|, branches (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"] = Table[N[Max[Table[Abs[rhoOf[2, io, ib]/rhoOf[1, io, ib] - 1], {io, 18}]], 4], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tT3}, {\"Q-number identity for T: dev, vac Baxter res, Precision\", ToString[checks[\"T3 <v2(x)v2|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = det6[Fvac(w1,y)]/psiQ x top normalization: max rel dev, vacuum Baxter residual\"]]}, {\"(a) eps-independence (octet1, octet2, singlet)\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (a) eps-independence of rho_B: max over 18 om of |rho(4e-6)/rho(1e-6) - 1|, branches (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"]]}, {\"rho at om A, eps=1e-6 (octet1, octet2, singlet)\", ToString[N[Table[rhoOf[1, ioA, ib], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}], 8]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* measured: rho_B is O(eps) for the octets (so the eps-independent quantity is rho_B/eps), eps-independent for the singlet. Tests on g := rho_B/eps (octets), rho_B (singlet): (a) eps-independence 1e-6 vs 4e-6, (b) phi-independence (phi' = (-2/5,3/8,7/11), 4 of the 18 om, eps = 1e-6), (c) eps -> 0 value g0 = (4 g(1e-6) - g(4e-6))/3 rationalized, and ratios g0(om)/g0(om') for pairs differing only in om2 and only in om1. *)\ngOf[k_, io_, ib_] := rhoOf[k, io, ib]/If[ib == 6, 1, epsL[[{1, 3}[[k]]]]];\nchecks[\"T3 (a') eps-independence of g = rho/eps (octets), rho (singlet): max over 18 om |g(4e-6)/g(1e-6) - 1|\"] = Table[N[Max[Table[Abs[gOf[2, io, ib]/gOf[1, io, ib] - 1], {io, 18}]], 4], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}];\nioSel = Table[Position[omGrid, o][[1, 1]], {o, {{3/4, -1/5}, {-5/3, 9/7}, {7/2, -12/5}, {3/4, 2/9}}}];\nT3c = Table[t3Data[phiC, 1, omGrid[[io]]], {io, ioSel}];\nphiIndep = Table[Table[N[T3c[[j, ib, \"rho\"]]/If[ib == 6, 1, epsL[[1]]]/gOf[1, ioSel[[j]], ib], 8], {j, 4}], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}];\nchecks[\"T3 (b) phi-independence: g(phi')/g(phi), 4 om, (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"] = phiIndep;\ng0Of[io_, ib_] := (4 gOf[1, io, ib] - gOf[2, io, ib])/3;\nrat20[io_, ib_] := Rationalize[N[g0Of[io, ib]], 10^-9];\nratioPairs2 = Flatten[Table[{{i1, i2}, {i1, i2 + 1}}, {i1, 3}, {i2, {1, 3, 5}}], 1];\nratioPairs1 = Flatten[Table[{{i1, i2}, {i1 + 1, i2}}, {i1, 2}, {i2, 6}], 1];\nioOfPair[{i1_, i2_}] := (i1 - 1) 6 + i2;\npairRatio[p_, ib_] := N[g0Of[ioOfPair[p[[1]]], ib]/g0Of[ioOfPair[p[[2]]], ib], 6];\nchecks[\"T3 (c) g0 = lim g (octet1, octet2, singlet) over the 18 om, rationalized at 1e-9\"] = Table[Table[rat20[io, ib], {io, 18}], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}];\nchecks[\"T3 (c) distinct values of g0 over the 18 om (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"] = Table[Length[Union[Round[N[Table[g0Of[io, ib], {io, 18}]], 10^-7]]], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}];\nchecks[\"T3 (c) om1-dependence: ratios g0(om1,om2)/g0(om1',om2), 12 pairs, max |ratio - 1| (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"] = Table[Max[Table[Abs[pairRatio[p, ib] - 1], {p, ratioPairs1}]], {ib, {4, 5, 6}}];\nchecks[\"T3 (c) om2-dependence: ratios g0(om1,om2)/g0(om1,om2'), 9 pairs\"] = Table[pairRatio[p, 4], {p, ratioPairs2}];\nGrid[{{\"(a') eps-independence of g (octet1, octet2, singlet)\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (a') eps-independence of g = rho/eps (octets), rho (singlet): max over 18 om |g(4e-6)/g(1e-6) - 1|\"]]}, {\"(b) g(phi')/g(phi), 4 om\", ToString[phiIndep]}, {\"(c) rationalized g0 octet1, 18 om\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (c) g0 = lim g (octet1, octet2, singlet) over the 18 om, rationalized at 1e-9\"][[1]]]}, {\"(c) rationalized g0 octet2\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (c) g0 = lim g (octet1, octet2, singlet) over the 18 om, rationalized at 1e-9\"][[2]]]}, {\"(c) rationalized g0 singlet\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (c) g0 = lim g (octet1, octet2, singlet) over the 18 om, rationalized at 1e-9\"][[3]]]}, {\"distinct g0 values over 18 om\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (c) distinct values of g0 over the 18 om (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"]]}, {\"om1-only ratios: max |ratio-1|\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (c) om1-dependence: ratios g0(om1,om2)/g0(om1',om2), 12 pairs, max |ratio - 1| (octet1, octet2, singlet)\"]]}, {\"om2-only ratios octet1 (9 pairs)\", ToString[checks[\"T3 (c) om2-dependence: ratios g0(om1,om2)/g0(om1,om2'), 9 pairs\"]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
