  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 4. Closed form of the singlet contamination ratio K/S as a function of t = theta12/h\r\n\r\nCorrected result: K/S = -t/(3(t-2)), kappa = 1 + K/S = 2(t-3)/(3(t-2)). (The first version of this task reported -(62/105)/(t-2); that came from the `Do`/`DownValues` HoldAll purge bug of the scan below, fixed in cell 36.)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
