  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* scan in t at h = 1, theta = (t, 0): the memoized objects that depend on (h, theta) are purged by purge[], the globals th12, t12, y0, th1 reset. K/S of the singlet (chain side) at eps = 1e-6 and 2e-6, first-order Richardson 2 f(e) - f(2e). Law: K/S = -t/(3(t-2)). NB: the first version of this cell had a purge[] written with Do[DownValues[f] = ..., {f, ...}]; DownValues is HoldAll, so nothing was purged and the scan reported -(62/105)/(t-2) (P1's stale t12 in the numerator). purge[] below uses literal symbols (as in cell 36). P1 is restored at the end of the cell. *)\npurge[] := (DownValues[Tm] = Select[DownValues[Tm], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[tBasisC] = Select[DownValues[tBasisC], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[tZof] = Select[DownValues[tZof], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[wgt] = Select[DownValues[wgt], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; DownValues[branchesAt] = Select[DownValues[branchesAt], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &];);\nsetPoint[hh_, ths_] := (hN = hh; thN = ths; th12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]]; t12 = th12/hN; y0 = (th12 - hN)/(th12 - 2 hN); th1 = thN[[1]]; purge[]);\nksRich[ph_, om_] := Module[{f = Table[With[{R = reg[e, ph, om[[1]], om[[2]]]}, With[{d = t1Point[branchesAt[R[\"z\"]], R][[6]]}, d[\"K\"]/d[\"S\"]]], {e, {10^-6, 2 10^-6}}]}, {2 f[[1]] - f[[2]], f}];\ntList = {29/15, 5/2, 3/2, 7/3, 11/4, 13/5, 9/4, 17/6};\nomB4 = {7/2, -7/4};\n{tScan, scan4} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[setPoint[1, {t, 0}]; With[{a = ksRich[phiP, {3/4, -1/5}], b = ksRich[phiP, omB4]}, {t, a[[1]], b[[1]], -t/(3 (t - 2))}], {t, tList}]];\nsetPoint[1/2, {2/7, -3/5}];\nchecks[\"T4 scan rows (t, K/S at om A, K/S at om B, law)\"] = scan4;\nchecks[\"T4 P1 restored\"] = {hN, thN, th12, t12, y0};\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{r[[1]], N[Re[r[[2]]], 10], N[Re[r[[3]]], 10], N[r[[4]], 10], ScientificForm[N[Abs[r[[2]] - r[[4]]], 3]], ScientificForm[N[Abs[r[[3]] - r[[4]]], 3]]}, {r, scan4}], {\"t\", \"K/S (om A)\", \"K/S (om B)\", \"law -t/(3(t-2))\", \"|A - law|\", \"|B - law|\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Law: K/S = -t/(3(t-2)), hence kappa = 1 + K/S = 2(t-3)/(3(t-2)); kappa(P1) = 43/12. (The earlier -(62/105)/(t-2) was the HoldAll purge bug of the scan in cell 27, see cell 36.) Check of the scan: *)\nresid4 = Table[{r[[1]], Re[r[[2]] - r[[4]]], Re[r[[3]] - r[[4]]]}, {r, scan4}];\nchecks[\"T4 max |K/S + t/(3(t-2))| over 8 t (om A, om B)\"] = N[Max[Abs[resid4[[All, 2 ;; 3]]]], 3];\nkapOf[t_] := 2 (t - 3)/(3 (t - 2));\nchecks[\"T4 kappa(P1) = 43/12\"] = kapOf[t12] === 43/12;\n(* Q-side singlet CG: C^Q = Qnum/(kappa phi012), phi012 = exact finite-eps (0,1,2) component of u12phi (delta^Lambda included); chain side C = [P_HW Psi_singlet]_((0,1,2), e1) *)\nidx012s = First[idxOf[{0, 1, 2}]];\nphi012[R_] := N[u12phi[R[\"z\"], R[\"w1\"], R[\"y\"]][[idx012s]], pr];\nchainSing[ie_] := With[{b = brOf[branchesAt[reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 1, 1][\"z\"]], {2, 2, 2}, 1]}, PHWc[{2, 2, 2}][b[\"psi\"]][[(idx012s - 1) d1 + 1]]];\nqSing[qn_, R_] := qn/(kapOf[t12] phi012[R]);\ncq4 = Table[Table[qSing[T2[[k, io, \"qnum\"]][[6]], reg[epsL[[epsIx[[k]]]], phiP, omGrid[[io, 1]], omGrid[[io, 2]]]], {io, 18}], {k, 2}];\nccS = Table[chainSing[ie], {ie, epsIx}];\nsingTab = Table[{N[Max[Abs[cq4[[k]]/Mean[cq4[[k]]] - 1]], 4], N[Max[Abs[cq4[[k]]/ccS[[k]] - 1]], 4]}, {k, 2}];\n(* Richardson at om A, f = C eps^6 (singlet ||Psi|| exponent -6) *)\nfqS = Table[qSing[q3[[ie, \"qnum\"]][[6]], reg[epsL[[ie]], phiP, 3/4, -1/5]] epsL[[ie]]^6, {ie, 3}]; fcS = Table[chainSing[ie] epsL[[ie]]^6, {ie, 3}];\nrcS = rich[fcS][[3]]; rqS = rich[fqS][[3]];\nchecks[\"T4 singlet CG: (spread, err vs chain) at eps = 1e-6; 4e-6; Richardson chain, Q, agreement\"] = {singTab, N[Re[rcS], 12], N[Re[rqS], 12], N[Abs[rqS/rcS - 1], 3]};\nGrid[{{\"max |K/S + t/(3(t-2))|\", ScientificForm[checks[\"T4 max |K/S + t/(3(t-2))| over 8 t (om A, om B)\"], 3]}, {\"kappa(P1)\", 43/12}, {\"singlet C^Q: (spread over 18 om, error vs chain) at 1e-6\", ToString[singTab[[1]]]}, {\"... at 4e-6\", ToString[singTab[[2]]]}, {\"Richardson chain, Q, |Q/chain-1|\", ToString[checks[\"T4 singlet CG: (spread, err vs chain) at eps = 1e-6; 4e-6; Richardson chain, Q, agreement\"][[2 ;; 4]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
