  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* P2: h = 1/3, theta = (1/5, -4/9), t = 29/15 (in the fit set of Delta(t)); fresh build through the fixed setPoint *)\nsetPoint[1/3, {1/5, -4/9}];\nchecks[\"P2 point: (h, theta, t, y0), no om component equals a phi component\"] = {hN, thN, t12, y0, And @@ Flatten[Table[! MemberQ[phiP, o], {o, Union[Flatten[omGrid]]}]]};\n{tF2, fin2} = AbsoluteTiming[finalRun[]];\nsetPoint[1/2, {2/7, -3/5}];\nshowFinal[fin2]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
